- ./styles/648-hyper-light-drifter.png : Hyper Light Drifter pixel art: detailed neon-pink and cyan pixels, a ruined pastel wilderness, a cloak over the sweater. She is a large pixel-art figure with coffee, not a tiny sprite. No UI or text.

